 da SELIC e prazo de dez anos para pagar, diz m</h2><p class="dark-muted" style="font-size:13px;line-height:16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0;font-family:Manrope, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:#3b3947">Medida provisória publicada hoje libera R$ 20 bilhões via BNDES para empresas com faturamento de até R$ 4,8 milhões por ano; bancos começam a operar as linhas na próxima semana, com carência</p><a href="https://example.com/noticias/credito-pequenas-empresas" style="color:#6a4df4;text-decoration-line:none;font-family:Manrope, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:15px;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Ler matéria completa<!-- --> →</a></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="pad dark-card" style="padding:28px 40px 24px 40px;border-bottom:1px solid #dcd9e4"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:10px;line-height:12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0;font-family:&#x27;Geist Mono&#x27;, &#x27;Courier New&#x27;, Courier, monospace;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5f5c6a">Economia</p><h2 class="dark-text" style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0;font-family:Manrope, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:22px;font-weight:700;color:#121019">SELIC cai</h2><p class="dark-muted" style="font-size:13px;line-height:16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0;font-family:Manrope, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:#3b3947">Copom reduz a taxa para 10,5% ao ano.</p><a href="https://example.com/noticias/selic" style="color:#6a4df4;text-decoration-line:none;font-family:Manrope, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:15px;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Ler matéria completa<!-- --> →</a></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="pad dark-card" style="padding:28px 40px 24px 40px;border-bottom:1px solid #dcd9e4"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:10px;line-height:12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0;font-family:&#x27;Geist Mono&#x27;, &#x27;Courier New&#x27;, Courier, monospace;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5f5c6a">Inteligência Artificial</p><h2 class="dark-text" style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0;font-family:Manrope, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:22px;font-weight:700;color:#121019">IA generativa já responde por 40% das buscas na internet, diz novo relatório</h2><p class="dark-muted" style="font-size:13px;line-height:16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0;font-family:Manrope, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:#3b3947">Estudo da consultoria Gartner mostra aceleração do uso de IA em ferramentas de busca e impacto direto no tráfego orgânico.</p><a href="https://example.com/noticias/ia-buscas-internet" style="color:#6a4df4;text-decoration-line:none;font-family:Manrope, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:15px;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Ler matéria completa<!-- --> →</a></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="pad dark-card" style="padding:28px 40px 24px 40px;border-bottom:1px solid #dcd9e4"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:10px;line-height:12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0;font-family:&#x27;Geist Mono&#x27;, &#x27;Courier New&#x27;, Courier, monospace;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5f5c6a">Mercado de Trabalho</p><h2 class="dark-text" style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0;font-family:Manrope, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:22px;font-weight:700;color:#121019">Salários de profissionais de dados crescem 28% em 12 meses no Brasil</h2><p class="dark-muted" style="font-size:13px;line-height:16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0;font-family:Manrope, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:#3b3947">Levantamento do LinkedIn aponta alta demanda por engenheiros e analistas de dados com experiência em Python e SQL.</p><a href="https://example.com/noticias/salarios-dados-brasil" style="color:#6a4df4;text-decoration-line:none;font-family:Manrope, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:15px;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Ler matéria completa<!-- --> →</a></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="pad dark-card" style="padding:28px 40px 24px 40px;border-bottom:1px solid #dcd9e4"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:10px;line-height:12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0;font-family:&#x27;Geist Mono&#x27;, &#x27;Courier New&#x27;, Courier, monospace;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5f5c6a">Carreira</p><h2 class="dark-text" style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0;font-family:Manrope, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:22px;font-weight:700;color:#121019">Como líderes da Fortune 500 estruturam suas rotinas de aprendizado contínuo</h2><p class="dark-muted" style="font-size:13px;line-height:16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0;font-family:Manrope, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:#3b3947">Entrevistas com 12 executivos revelam hábitos comuns: leitura diária, podcasts e blocos de tempo protegido para estudo.</p><a href="https://example.com/noticias/lideres-aprendizado" style="color:#6a4df4;text-decoration-line:none;font-family:Manrope, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:15px;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Ler matéria completa<!-- --> →</a></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" w